10. Risks
Phase 6 starts late if the go-ahead or the report owner's answers are slow.
The Q1 2027 move to Cloud may change Jira URLs and field ids and force the Cloud client earlier, which pushes Phase 2 or 7 back.
AUTO-56 Phase 3 needs GitLab write access that is not set up. Without it the plan ends at Phase 1.
Local pytest has been blocked on the laptop since 2026-11-12. Tests run in the GitLab pipeline on a merge request until IT clears the request.
The estimates are judgment, not measurements. The phase ranges exclude experts' time and waits for access and approvals.
Capacity is an assumption. If the real allocation is lower, the stretch items drop first, then AUTO-56 Phase 1.
